{"title": "Vest of Soul Rejuvenation", "pageid": 8035, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation", "categories": ["Clothing", "Very rare items", "Sources of healing", "Self-Heal set", "Soul set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Icon.png/300px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/7/78/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Vest of Soul Rejuvenation image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Icon.png/300px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Vest of Soul Rejuvenation</span></a> is a very rare piece of <a href=\"/wiki/Clothing\" title=\"Clothing\">Clothing</a>. It heals the wearer on a successful saving throw against a spell and allows them to use a <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> to make an Unarmed Attack against any attacker that misses.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A garment worn by one of three monks who fought together against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Headless_Serpent,_Secret_Venom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Headless Serpent, Secret Venom\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Headless_Serpent,_Secret_Venom\">Headless Serpent, Secret Venom</a></span>, a gang in the port city of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Port_Nyanzaru\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nyanzaru\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Port_Nyanzaru\">Nyanzaru</a></span>. This was worn by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Strigga_Morkoscavich\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Strigga Morkoscavich\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Strigga_Morkoscavich\">Strigga Morkoscavich</a></span>, whose stances moved fluidly, flawlessly, and who defanged the Serpent one blustery night.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-ac-value\" style=\"grid-template-columns: 42px; 1fr\">\n<div><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/60px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/80px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"ac-value\" aria-label=\"Armour class: 10\">10</div>\n<div class=\"ac-value-comment\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> + <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity#Dexterity_Modifier_Chart\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity modifier</a></div>\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clothing\" title=\"Clothing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Clothing_Icon.png/25px-Clothing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Clothing_Icon.png/38px-Clothing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Clothing_Icon.png/50px-Clothing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Clothing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Clothing_Icon.png/25px-Clothing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Clothing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Clothing\" title=\"Clothing\">Clothing</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 1.8 kg (3.6 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 1.8 kg (3.6 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 4160 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  4160  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_BarbMonk_Cloth_A_2_Late</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_BarbMonk_Cloth_A_2_Late\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_BarbMonk_Cloth_A_2_Late\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">1c69a87e-9136-4e13-90af-c0f02d0fc81f</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1c69a87e-9136-4e13-90af-c0f02d0fc81f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1c69a87e-9136-4e13-90af-c0f02d0fc81f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Monk_SoulRejunevation_Armor</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Monk_SoulRejunevation_Armor+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Monk_SoulRejunevation_Armor+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> +2</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Defier%27s_Rejuvenation\" title=\"Defier's Rejuvenation\">Defier's Rejuvenation</a></dt><dd>Whenever the wearer succeeds on a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throw</a> against a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">Spell</a>, they regain <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/38px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/50px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">hit points</span></a>.</dd></dl><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Kushigo_Counter\" title=\"Greater Kushigo Counter\">Greater Kushigo Counter</a></dt><dd>The wearer can use a <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> to make an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Unarmed Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/30px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmed Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Unarmed Strike\">Unarmed Strike</a> against any attacker that misses.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan%27s_Projection\" title=\"Lorroakan's Projection\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png/25px-Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png/38px-Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png/50px-Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lorroakan's Projection\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png/25px-Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan%27s_Projection\" title=\"Lorroakan's Projection\">Lorroakan's Projection</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a> if <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/25px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/38px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/50px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rolan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/25px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan</a> is dead</li>\n<li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/25px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/38px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/50px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rolan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/25px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a> if Rolan and Lorroakan are both alive</li>\n<li>Sold by Rolan via trade option on the bottom left during the dialogue in <a href=\"/wiki/Ramazith%27s_Tower\" title=\"Ramazith's Tower\">Ramazith's Tower</a> if Rolan is alive but Lorroakan is dead</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Greater Kushigo Counter:</i></p>\n<ul><li><b>Greater Kushigo Counter</b> triggers <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a>, if used during a player character's turn.\n<ul><li>If this attack is done while Extra Attack (from a normal attack) is activated, both Extra Attacks (from normal attack and Greater Kushigo Counter) are lost.\n<ul><li>Sentinel: Vengeance attack from an enemy can trigger Greater Kushigo Counter at the wrong moment and cause the loss of both Extra Attacks.</li></ul></li>\n<li>On Honour mode, monks with an extra <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> (at least from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/30px-Haste_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/40px-Haste_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\">Haste</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Bloodlust\" title=\"Elixir of Bloodlust\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Bloodlust\" title=\"Elixir of Bloodlust\">Elixir of Bloodlust</a>) can get Extra Attack only once per turn, while characters without extra actions get Extra Attack for both the normal attack and the Greater Kushigo Counter. Thus, both a hasted and a non-hasted monk can get 4 attacks per turn using Greater Kushigo Counter.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Appearance in game</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 302px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 300px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_ingame.png/450px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_ingame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_ingame.png/675px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_ingame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_ingame.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Vest of Soul Rejuvenation worn by Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_ingame.png/450px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_ingame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Models</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 100px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 98px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Front Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Human_Front_Model.webp/147px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Human_Front_